                                                "sense_id": "ca353002-8d26-3c45-899a-726af7c8480e",
                                                "text": "Furthermore, in order to eliminate friction between the ECs of soviets and the Chekas in the provinces, Dzerzhinsky was appointed people's commissar of internal affairs […]"
